SUMMARY:General Meeting with Afterparty🇨🇿🇸🇰
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/semester-meet-up-hs22/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/R%C3%A4mistrasse+59,+8001+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3721109,8.549581,19z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x479aa0ae934941d3:0x3324d67e2e8d5700!8m2!3d47.3721109!4d8.5501282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UZH RAA-E-30</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>), Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>), René Čáky (<a class="link" href="mailto:rene.caky@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">rene.caky@cssz.ch</a>)\n\n<p>Thank You everyone for coming. The most important news from the General Meeting: Timon Fopp has been elected to replace Šimon Hrabec in the board since he resigned from the function.</p> <p>We hope you enjoyed the afterparty! :)</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAALCAIAAADwazoUAAACIElEQVR4nEyRXUsVXxTGnzWz97ydVxXPX/&#43;Wip4SLMnqog7WRRdKdFEUfYM&#43;RvRduqwLISiCLsSCKIgIIYSMUBJfktN5c8Yzzszee8UoRGs9/O5&#43;PLCWeCzvRMQRUQSEyBkxInNKOmIYnA6d5N8l4RlWRMqizHAGaJAyJ2TWRIooZmNRbjKDGZZFRGQMM0O4BilrG8q3/VSrPrQNS0PZkIa1ASw4mpO8CRKwtFF5BSRBCoF0Yu68nPxv5eXr/8dmFh8s9KJYDpba3aPEolibV2/Wbi7NDw9XdvdaAA0NlQsF7/vGzvLye/seTVXPjT988UQ3k&#43;hXd&#43;HRolHm4o0LWaKmZ8fnrtZ/bu7fvd&#43;oz4xFYdxuR/X6aKMxk2a8&#43;nabnmIpDYLBW5cSorWVNTNQOEx1J85MOWj1k9QRibC3u&#43;GZyalabSgMj0eHR5qdSIrK6scdeo7bIbiFOARl8DvI2C9hsLy5e5AJt6d0G6o6WjN&#43;6dvWb0cOVCs1WAWlvFbbFi6giKpWUQARKDbp2SvT1dmJ8Nm7icZ8K0o&#43;f/lx7frlRPrrm5&#43;OVXm/yfnt4ABl4eVfoVTDATlkBeyFW51uK0NfrK9sHJFjm/LXD83Y9gKMJFw0FAABUGQuChcyg5WBFGzFpCB6e/3eXuwgkJAC0oHTOVARsiIqhr3j3DyNJzzYKpftvymQYBKHRmQQCo6CUyKX4DK7HnwFT8EDHED8GQD7gwte&#43;b4aewAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_436ed401751f51d9.webp 1920w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_436ed401751f51d9.webp 1920w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_af9a48482a6016d3.webp 640w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_43937b812cfe95d7.webp 1024w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_fb3447d33b432fe5.webp 1600w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_6696b757d2a177c1.jpg 1920w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_6696b757d2a177c1.jpg 1920w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_fb0bc535d60bb9ed.jpg 640w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_c1186d6150fe0343.jpg 1024w, /images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_6122eeb651e84305.jpg 1600w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2022-11-12-gm/gm_hu_6696b757d2a177c1.jpg"                  width="1920"                  height="1080"                                                                                     /></picture> <hr> <p>According to the statutes, we are convening a General Meeting on 12.11.2022. We will briefly present our activities and plans for the future, followed by an afterparty. Snacks and drinks will be provided. Come, help us get better and enjoy a true Czechoslovakian party!</p>
